      }
    },
    "Apple Music 輸出到虛擬裝置，由本 App 獨佔 DAC 原樣轉送，取樣率跟著每首歌切換。Music 停止 10 分鐘後交還 DAC。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Music plays into a virtual device and this app takes exclusive access to the DAC to pass the samples on unchanged, switching the sample rate for each song. The DAC is released after Music has been stopped for 10 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
