    "macOS 音量滑桿控制的是 DAC 自己的音量，不是 100% 時 DAC 可能會縮放數位訊號。開啟後本地與 Apple Music 播放時都拉到最大，停止時還原；串流的大小聲用播放列的滑桿調整。DAC 直接推耳機或主動喇叭時聲音會突然變大，請先確認後級音量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The macOS volume slider controls the DAC's own volume. Below 100%, the DAC may scale the digital signal. When this is on, the volume goes to maximum during local and Apple Music playback and is restored when playback stops. Use the slider in the playback bar to adjust streaming loudness. If the DAC drives headphones or active speakers directly, the sound can suddenly get louder, so check your downstream volume first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
